[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13443.75, "timestamp": "03:44:03", "text": "鱼类。该死的，一条鱼都没有了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13446.63, "timestamp": "03:44:06", "text": "在篝火旁为我烹煮。建造一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13450.5, "timestamp": "03:44:10", "text": "卧室。我全都做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13465.11, "timestamp": "03:44:25", "text": "你们什么时候有这种感觉？告诉我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13467.11, "timestamp": "03:44:27", "text": "东西准备好了。哦，你可以睡觉了。经过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13471.51, "timestamp": "03:44:31", "text": "夜幕降临，道路也随之开启。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13475.349, "timestamp": "03:44:35", "text": "是的。是的，那是我最喜欢之一。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13477.87, "timestamp": "03:44:37", "text": "我需要完成的任务。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13480.269, "timestamp": "03:44:40", "text": "呃，该怎么做？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13485.91, "timestamp": "03:44:45", "text": "我又要卷睡袋了吗？哦，我必须"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13487.67, "timestamp": "03:44:47", "text": "B. 那么，你有配方吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13489.269, "timestamp": "03:44:49", "text": "它？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13492.51, "timestamp": "03:44:52", "text": "呃，好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13496.87, "timestamp": "03:44:56", "text": "篝火、基本建筑工具包、走廊"}]